## ⚠️ Limitations

- Research quality depends on the sources returned by the web-search tool.
- LLM-generated responses can contain inaccuracies.
- External API usage may incur costs.
- Python execution should only be enabled in a trusted environment.
- The public repository contains a sanitized workflow export; credentials must be configured locally.

